[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30200200_01_0010","text":"唔——……\n完全搞不懂啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30200200_01_0020","text":"嗯、嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30200200_01_0030","text":"全交给灯织……也太甩手掌柜了嘛\n怎么办……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30200200_01_0040","text":"『４↑６＊３６←＊９↑』\n『４↑６＊３６←＊９↑』……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30200200_01_0050","text":"──────啊\n原来如此，是这样……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30200200_01_0060","text":"……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30200200_01_0070","text":"……灯织酱，解出来了……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30200200_01_0080","text":"嗯，应该是对的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30200200_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30200200_01_0090","text":"答案一定就是那栋大楼"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30200200_01_0100","text":"……！"}]
